 @subsection H.264 options
 
 @table @option
+@item startup_fullres @var{boolean}
+Use full-resolution multipass analysis for the first two pictures, then restore
+quarter-resolution analysis. The default is 0.
+
+This option requires @option{multipass=qres}, CBR, no B-frames or lookahead,
+and @option{delay=0}. Encoding fails if the driver rejects the mode change.
+
 @item profile @var{integer}
 Set the H.264 profile using a named value from the table (recommended)
 or its integer. The default is @samp{high} (2).
